Activity-domain proof added:
- AppGameEvidenceClaimSchema accepts weak display-name-only evidence only when
  unlinked and low-confidence.
- AppGameEvidenceClaimSchema rejects inventory evidence that claims running or
  foreground state.
- AppGameEvidenceClaimSchema rejects launcher evidence that claims known game
  without child-game proof.
- AppGameAiClassificationDigestSchema accepts classify/review hints and rejects
  enforcement authority strings such as terminate.

Parent-domain proof added:
- AppGameControlApprovalAuthoritySchema rejects observe-only authorities that
  grant approval/write powers.
- AppGameControlApprovalRequestSchema rejects missing evidence references.
- AppGameControlApprovalRequestSchema rejects cross-kind policy setting refs.
- AppGameControlApprovalDecisionSchema rejects stale parent-action policy
  version references.
- AppGameControlActionResultSchema rejects manual-required strict execution,
  launcher-only game dispatch, unknown-app dispatch, and denied/enforced
  conflicts.
